      <h1 class="article-title">Westminster Shorter Catechism</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">1647</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">107 questions and answers teaching the essentials of Reformed Christian doctrine.</p>
      
      
